[{"id":181524358,"discussion_id":"252fb088a59a0bd218f3960cd1363e3526799a66","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 BAND 模式（`mask_mode=4`）下 `MergeMask` 函数中 `loopCount` 计算越界导致精度失败的问题。原先 `halfS1RealSize` 被硬编码 `+1` 且使用直接整数除法，导致在某些 `s2BaseSize` 下 `loopCount` 偏大，`MergeBand` 向 UB buffer 之外多写一整行 mask 数据，破坏相邻 buffer 产生精度错误。修复通过移除多余的 `+1` 并改用向上取整（ceil）除法，确保所有尺寸下 `loopCount` 计算正确。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`halfS1RealSizeLoop` 移除多余 +1**：将 `halfS1RealSizeLoop = static_cast<uint16_t>(halfS1RealSize) + 1` 改为 `halfS1RealSizeLoop = static_cast<uint16_t>(halfS1RealSize)`，消除循环次数高估的根源。\n- **`loopCount` 改用向上取整除法**：将 `(halfS1RealSizeLoop / rowNumEachLoop) * rowNumTimesEachLoop` 改为 `(halfS1RealSizeLoop + rowNumEachLoop - 1) / rowNumEachLoop * rowNumTimesEachLoop`，确保在各 `s2BaseSize` 下均能正确计算所需的循环轮次，避免越界写入。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-24T15:21:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-24T15:39:37+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181524388,"discussion_id":"b950e9131c81958d5532fede1ec2cfbcaec03b2f","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|---------